# Package ids published to nuget.org, one per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# This file is machine-read twice: the release workflow names each id explicitly in its push and
# its GitHub release, and PackagingTests asserts that every packable project appears here or in
# packages.local. Adding a packable project without classifying it FAILS THE BUILD, which is the
# whole point — the alternative is discovering it after a permanent publish.
#
# ⛔ Every id here must be covered by the repository's ONE trusted-publishing policy. nuget.org
# mints one API key per token exchange scoped to one matching policy, so a policy per id does not
# work: the first id publishes permanently and the rest are rejected 403 in the same command.

# All four are covered by the policy pattern `Bennewitz.Ninja.AppServices*` — note no dot before
# the wildcard, so it matches the bare stem as well as the suffixed siblings.
Bennewitz.Ninja.AppServices
Bennewitz.Ninja.AppServices.Abstractions
Bennewitz.Ninja.AppServices.Logging
Bennewitz.Ninja.AppServices.Avalonia
